 '## Evidence architecture and binding policy','',
 'All runtime files are isolated in [source_evidence_adapters](source_evidence_adapters/). `EvidencePackage` contains existing `IdentityEvidence` instances plus explicit claim scopes, source attributes and consistency observations. Source name, record type/ID, original value, payload hash/path, cached row pointer, field path, mapping version, source spans/rules, dependencies and unresolved obligations are retained. Package scope metadata is the smallest extension: neither the existing typed evidence schema nor the reconciliation/comparison core changed.',
 '',
 'The default-off [scoped evaluator](source_evidence_adapters/scoped_evaluator.py) asks three distinct questions:',
 '',
