 '',
 'The adapter recomputes Standard InChI and its full key from each validated graph and records agreement or an unresolved inconsistency. Equality validates only that encoded projection. These identifiers and a generated name depend on the originating graph. Multiple fields or SIDs never count as independent votes. Candidate-derived roots, missing dependencies and cycles cannot corroborate themselves. Existing core lineage checks and explicit-root regression cases enforce this.',
